[
  {
    "beat": 1,
    "flux": "A weathered female lighthouse keeper in oilskin coat and wool beanie kneels on wet stone dock at blue hour dawn, holding a dripping fishing net. A small translucent fish glows soft cyan inside the mesh, illuminating her shocked face. Wide medium shot, low angle from water level, rule of thirds with keeper left, horizon low. Lens 50mm, shallow depth of field. Cool dawn light mixes with warm golden glow from fish, mist in air. Palette of slate blue, seafoam, amber. Painterly photorealism, cinematic film grain, detailed texture of wood and wool.",
    "ltx": "Silent clip. Keeper's fingers slowly tighten in net, water drips from mesh in slow droplets. Glowing fish pulses faintly, cyan light flickers across keeper's face and wet stones. Gentle mist drifts. Camera holds static then slow dolly in 20% over 4 seconds, shallow rack focus from net to keeper's eyes. Pacing slow, contemplative, slight handheld micro-shake. No music, no speech."
  },
  {
    "beat": 2,
    "flux": "A middle-aged lighthouse keeper climbs narrow spiral stone staircase inside lighthouse tower, cradling a glowing cyan fish in both hands. Wet oilskin drips, net draped over shoulder. Storm clouds press against small porthole windows. Composition centered on vertical spiral, keeper ascending frame left to right, fish glow illuminating dust particles. Lens 35mm, slight barrel distortion emphasizing curve. Dramatic chiaroscuro: cool bluish storm light from windows vs warm cyan glow. Palette of slate gray, deep navy, electric cyan, amber wood. Moody cinematic realism, wet textures, high detail.",
    "ltx": "Silent clip. Keeper's boots climb stone steps, steady upward motion, fish glows pulsing softly. Water drips from coat, net sways. Storm wind rattles porthole glass, clouds roll fast outside. Camera tracks upward with keeper in slow vertical tilt following ascent, slight handheld bounce. Pacing deliberate and tense, 5 seconds. Light flickers from fish. No music, no speech."
  },
  {
    "beat": 3,
    "flux": "A high, circular lighthouse lamp room at dawn storm, keeper places glowing cyan fish on brass pedestal beside massive Fresnel lens. Fish light floods whitewashed stone walls, refracting into warm gold beam projecting through lantern windows. Composition centered on lens, keeper small left, fish luminous foreground. Wide 24mm lens from slightly below, emphasizing dome architecture. Light: volumetric god rays, cyan core shifting to honey gold. Palette of brass, creamy white, gold, cyan. Hyperreal painterly style, luminous bloom, intricate mechanical detail.",
    "ltx": "Silent clip. Keeper sets fish down gently, fish pulses brighter, cyan light spills outward flooding lamp room walls. Fresnel lens slowly rotates, beam sweeps outward, color shifts from cyan to gold. Dust motes swirl in volumetric light. Camera slow arc right around lens, 6 seconds, parallax on brass rings. Pacing builds from still to radiant. No music, no speech."
  },
  {
    "beat": 4,
    "flux": "A small distressed fishing schooner in churning midnight sea, navigating narrow reef channel under storm sky. Golden lighthouse beam cuts through rain and fog, illuminating bow and white rocks. Composition low on water level, ship centered right, beam diagonal from upper left. Telephoto 85mm lens compresses distance, isolating ship against cliffs. Light: stark gold beam against deep indigo and charcoal storm, wet highlights on waves. Palette of midnight blue, foam white, gold, slate gray. Cinematic maritime realism, dramatic contrast, fine spray detail.",
    "ltx": "Silent clip. Ship plows forward through rolling waves, bow lifts and crashes, spray arcs. Golden beam sweeps steady across deck and rocks, rain sheets across frame. Camera holds locked off slightly low on water, then very slow push in toward bow over 5 seconds. Pacing urgent but controlled, waves rise and fall rhythmically. No music, no speech."
  }
]
